exports[`fully loaded golden wills > summary v1, every line 1`] = `
"Your will in plain words

This summary helps you check your choices. The will below is the legal document.

Sunita Verma will carry out your will as executor, with Arjun Verma as back-up.

Sunita Verma will look after your children under 18, with Vikas Verma as back-up.

Equity - My Portfolio will go to Arjun Verma.

Flat 4B, Shanti Apartments, Pune will go to Sunita Verma.

Honda City (MH12AB1234) will go to Meera Verma (50%).

Honda City (MH12AB1234) will go to Vikas Verma (50%).

Anil Shah receives ₹25,000.75.

Pune Animal Trust receives ₹50,000.

Everything else is shared: Arjun Verma 40%, Sunita Verma 60%.

If Arjun Verma dies before you or within thirty days of you, their gifts go to Sunita Verma.

If Meera Verma dies before you or within thirty days of you, their gifts go to Arjun Verma.

Only your share of jointly held assets passes under the will.

Insurance and nominated accounts are paid to the nominee first.

Your will counts only once you sign it in front of two adult witnesses who are not beneficiaries (or the spouse of one), and they sign it too. Registration is optional.
"
`;

